{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34037","headline":"润卿遗青䭀饭兼之一绝聊用荅谢 · 皮日休","name":"润卿遗青䭀饭兼之一绝聊用荅谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"传得三元䭀饭名，大宛闻说有仙卿。\n分泉过屋舂青稻，拂雾彯衣折紫茎。\n蒸处不教双鹤见，服来唯怕五云生。\n草堂空坐无饥色，时把金津漱一声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}